agent skill directories by `sentra install`. They are third-party playbooks,
not Sentra code, and remain under their upstream licenses. Each skill directory
carries the upstream license text: LICENSE (copied by Sentra from the
repository root at the pinned commit) or LICENSE.txt (shipped by upstream
inside the skill directory).

